  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iraq - NRC Strategic Partnership Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flyktninghjelpen/NRC in Iraq works to address the multi-faceted needs of displaced individuals, ensuring their safety, dignity, and well-being while promoting their integration and empowerment within host communities.?NRC Iraq implements an integrated durable solutions&#x2019; approach to provide direct services and respond to emergency needs while supporting longer-term recovery. Sectors include Education. The project design is informed by a gender analysis and all indicators are disaggregated by sex.</narrative>
  </description>
